# Automatic Agent Identity retirement gate
#
# The action runner continues automatically when:
# - Part 3.1 and Part 3.2 proved Registration deletion;
# - complete healthy inventory proves the companion Package is absent;
# - the mapping records companionPackage.status=retired;
# - the Agent Identity was created exclusively for this source;
# - no runtime binding, app-role assignment, membership, grant, policy, owner
#   workflow, or other consumer still requires it; and
# - retirementApprovedAt is populated.
#
# A failed dependency or verification check blocks the workflow instead of
# requesting another approval.

