###############################################################################
# Final tombstone checkpoint - no request
#
# Preserve:
# - tenant, platform, provider scope, and exact provider sourceAgentId
# - former Package, companion Registration, Agent Identity, and Blueprint IDs
# - provider deletion and Registry Sync confirmation timestamps
# - Registration DELETE/GET outcomes
# - Agent Identity and Blueprint DELETE/GET outcomes
# - dependency-review and approval references
# - lifecycleStatus and each per-object status, reason, and timestamp
# - blueprintCleanup status and any partial or blocked result
#
# Do not erase the mapping. It prevents stale inventory from silently creating
# a replacement companion. Do not delete the Registry Sync connection,
# provider credentials, or unrelated local evidence.
